Package: orion-probe
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: adduser, ike-scan, nmap, python3, python3-cryptography, python3-nmap, ssh-audit, systemd
Maintainer: LCIT CyberSecurity
Description: Orion remote observation probe
 A minimal HTTPS agent for Orion-initiated network observations.
 The probe reuses Orion's TLS, SSH and IPsec scan engines and stores pending
 results locally until the central Orion server acknowledges durable storage.
